#. :src: bpy.types.Image
msgid "Image data-block referencing an external or packed image"
msgstr "Bilddatablock som refererar till en extern eller packad bild"

#. :src: bpy.types.Image.alpha_mode
#. :src: bpy.types.IMAGE_OT_convert_to_mesh_plane.alpha_mode
#. :src: bpy.types.IMAGE_OT_import_as_mesh_planes.alpha_mode
msgid ""
"Representation of alpha in the image file, to convert to and from when "
"saving and loading the image"
msgstr ""
"Hur alfa representeras i bildfilen vid konvertering under lagring och "
"inläsning av bilden"

#. :src: bpy.types.Image.alpha_mode:'STRAIGHT'
#. :src: bpy.types.IMAGE_OT_convert_to_mesh_plane.alpha_mode:'STRAIGHT'
#. :src: bpy.types.IMAGE_OT_import_as_mesh_planes.alpha_mode:'STRAIGHT'
msgid ""
"Store RGB and alpha channels separately with alpha acting as a mask, also "
"known as unassociated alpha. Commonly used by image editing applications and "
"file formats like PNG."
msgstr ""
"Lagra RGB- och alfakanaler separat med alfa som fungerar som en mask, även "
"känd som oassocierad alfa. Används ofta av bildredigeringsprogram och "
"filformat som PNG."

#. :src: bpy.types.Image.alpha_mode:'PREMUL'
#. :src: bpy.types.CompositorNodeAlphaOver.premul
#. :src: bpy.types.IMAGE_OT_convert_to_mesh_plane.alpha_mode:'PREMUL'
#. :src: bpy.types.IMAGE_OT_import_as_mesh_planes.alpha_mode:'PREMUL'
#. :src: bpy.types.EffectStrip.alpha_mode:'PREMUL'
#. :src: bpy.types.ImageStrip.alpha_mode:'PREMUL'
#. :src: bpy.types.MaskStrip.alpha_mode:'PREMUL'
#. :src: bpy.types.MetaStrip.alpha_mode:'PREMUL'
#. :src: bpy.types.MovieClipStrip.alpha_mode:'PREMUL'
#. :src: bpy.types.MovieStrip.alpha_mode:'PREMUL'
#. :src: bpy.types.SceneStrip.alpha_mode:'PREMUL'
msgid "Premultiplied"
msgstr "Förmultiplicerad"

#. :src: bpy.types.Image.alpha_mode:'PREMUL'
#. :src: bpy.types.IMAGE_OT_convert_to_mesh_plane.alpha_mode:'PREMUL'
#. :src: bpy.types.IMAGE_OT_import_as_mesh_planes.alpha_mode:'PREMUL'
msgid ""
"Store RGB channels with alpha multiplied in, also known as associated alpha. "
"The natural format for renders and used by file formats like OpenEXR."
msgstr ""
"Lagra RGB-kanaler med alfavärdet inmultiplicerat, även kallat associerad "
"alfa. Det är det naturliga formatet för renderingar och används av filformat "
"som OpenEXR."

#. :src: bpy.types.Image.alpha_mode:'CHANNEL_PACKED'
#. :src: bpy.types.IMAGE_OT_convert_to_mesh_plane.alpha_mode:'CHANNEL_PACKED'
#. :src: bpy.types.IMAGE_OT_import_as_mesh_planes.alpha_mode:'CHANNEL_PACKED'
msgid "Channel Packed"
msgstr "Kanalpackad"

#. :src: bpy.types.Image.alpha_mode:'CHANNEL_PACKED'
#. :src: bpy.types.IMAGE_OT_convert_to_mesh_plane.alpha_mode:'CHANNEL_PACKED'
#. :src: bpy.types.IMAGE_OT_import_as_mesh_planes.alpha_mode:'CHANNEL_PACKED'
msgid ""
"Different images are packed in the RGB and alpha channels, and they should "
"not affect each other. Channel packing is commonly used by game engines to "
"save memory."
msgstr ""
"Olika bilder packas i RGB- och alfakanalerna, och de ska inte påverka "
"varandra. Kanalpaketering används ofta av spelmotorer för att spara minne."

#. :src: bpy.types.Image.alpha_mode:'NONE'
#. :src: bpy.types.IMAGE_OT_convert_to_mesh_plane.alpha_mode:'NONE'
#. :src: bpy.types.IMAGE_OT_import_as_mesh_planes.alpha_mode:'NONE'
msgid "Ignore alpha channel from the file and make image fully opaque"
msgstr "Ignorera alfakanalen från filen och gör bilden helt ogenomskinlig"
